Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Comment,,0,0,0,,---------------TEXT_JP----------------
Dialogue: 6,0:00:03.67,0:00:06.81,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,なんでいつもこんな立て掛けを加護さんは
Dialogue: 6,0:00:09.03,0:00:10.99,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,もう嫌だよ
Dialogue: 6,0:00:10.99,0:00:14.79,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,1番じゃなかったら　お母さんもツカサも間に合ったのに
Dialogue: 6,0:00:15.18,0:00:16.08,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,ツカサ
Dialogue: 6,0:00:18.62,0:00:20.33,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,ごめん　大丈夫
Dialogue: 6,0:00:20.33,0:00:22.17,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,ち… 違う　これ
Dialogue: 6,0:00:22.89,0:00:25.00,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,す… す… す… すみません　大丈夫です
Dialogue: 6,0:00:25.85,0:00:26.22,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,でも
Dialogue: 6,0:00:26.22,0:00:28.42,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,うちのりんなになんか用っすか
Dialogue: 6,0:00:28.80,0:00:30.47,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,あ　いや
Dialogue: 6,0:00:30.47,0:00:34.89,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,名港アシスタントコーチやってる雉多輝也
Dialogue: 6,0:00:36.05,0:00:39.02,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,ルクス東山ひがしやまの明浦路司です
Dialogue: 6,0:00:39.02,0:00:42.78,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,すみません　なんか泣いてたみたいだったので
Dialogue: 6,0:00:43.61,0:00:46.60,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,泣いてんの？まじだりわ
Dialogue: 6,0:00:47.32,0:00:48.33,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,行くぞ
Dialogue: 6,0:00:48.69,0:00:49.45,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,はい
Dialogue: 6,0:00:52.53,0:00:54.74,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,1番滑走か
Dialogue: 6,0:00:55.41,0:00:56.32,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,頑張れ
Dialogue: 6,0:02:31.48,0:02:33.01,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,跳んだすごいすごい
Dialogue: 6,0:02:34.55,0:02:36.18,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,もう帰りたい
Dialogue: 6,0:02:37.47,0:02:40.04,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,どこ見たらいいか分からないし
Dialogue: 6,0:02:40.36,0:02:41.97,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,試合始まってるの
Dialogue: 6,0:02:41.97,0:02:43.26,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,あ… いや
Dialogue: 6,0:02:43.62,0:02:48.28,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,多分まだ練習って言ってたような気がする
Dialogue: 6,0:02:48.28,0:02:49.93,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,いつ始まるの?
Dialogue: 6,0:02:49.93,0:02:51.48,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,えど
Dialogue: 6,0:02:53.91,0:02:55.24,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,気になるんでしょ
Dialogue: 6,0:02:55.91,0:02:57.74,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,司君のこと
Dialogue: 6,0:02:57.74,0:02:58.74,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,え?
Dialogue: 6,0:02:58.74,0:03:01.48,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,私はいいから　見に行ってあげて
Dialogue: 6,0:03:06.83,0:03:08.38,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,約束しただろ
Dialogue: 6,0:03:08.68,0:03:12.21,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,良くなったら羊と3人で観戦しに行くって
Dialogue: 6,0:03:13.21,0:03:15.74,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,その時　君から教えてもらうの
Dialogue: 6,0:03:15.74,0:03:17.39,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,楽しみにしているんだ
Dialogue: 6,0:03:17.79,0:03:20.34,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,フィギュアスケートの詳しいルールを
Dialogue: 6,0:03:24.11,0:03:26.51,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,お父さんも分からないから聞いてみよう
Dialogue: 6,0:03:30.06,0:03:31.65,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,あのすみません
Dialogue: 6,0:03:32.29,0:03:35.40,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,フィギュアスケートってどう観戦すればいいんですか
Dialogue: 6,0:03:35.98,0:03:39.22,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,え？か… 観戦は初めて
Dialogue: 6,0:03:39.22,0:03:42.51,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,はい　僕はルールなしでも楽しいんですが
Dialogue: 6,0:03:42.51,0:03:44.75,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,この子に楽しみ方を教えたくて
Dialogue: 6,0:03:44.75,0:03:45.64,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,ね
Dialogue: 6,0:03:47.97,0:03:50.84,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,とは言え　ルールは複雑なので
Dialogue: 6,0:03:50.84,0:03:53.78,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,子供にも分かるように説明というのも…
Dialogue: 6,0:03:53.78,0:03:56.20,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,初めてでも　分かるような
Dialogue: 6,0:03:56.20,0:03:59.01,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,見どころみたいなものってあったりするんですか
Dialogue: 6,0:03:59.01,0:04:00.81,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,フィギュアスケートを知らん小学生に
Dialogue: 6,0:04:00.81,0:04:03.51,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,あの複雑なルールを分かってもらう方法…?
Dialogue: 6,0:04:05.17,0:04:07.36,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,もういいよ　困ってるよ
Dialogue: 6,0:04:07.36,0:04:08.98,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,そんなことないよ
Dialogue: 6,0:04:09.38,0:04:10.39,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,ですよね
Dialogue: 6,0:04:10.98,0:04:12.17,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,も… もちろん
Dialogue: 6,0:04:12.17,0:04:17.14,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,演技の美しさや表現を見る芸術性は大きな楽しみの1つですが
Dialogue: 6,0:04:17.14,0:04:18.47,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,それ以外だと
Dialogue: 6,0:04:18.47,0:04:23.49,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,賭けを見守るスポーツという側面が挙げられると思います
Dialogue: 6,0:04:24.01,0:04:25.11,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,賭け?
Dialogue: 6,0:04:25.11,0:04:26.50,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,ギャンブル…
Dialogue: 6,0:04:26.50,0:04:29.06,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,氷の上は普通の人にとっては
Dialogue: 6,0:04:29.06,0:04:31.50,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,ツルツルというよりは　ヌルヌル
Dialogue: 6,0:04:31.50,0:04:35.88,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,常に転倒と隣り合わせで　絶対ということはない
Dialogue: 6,0:04:36.36,0:04:39.04,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,そんな環境の中ノービスＡでは
Dialogue: 6,0:04:39.04,0:04:42.14,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,各選手3分という演技時間で
Dialogue: 6,0:04:42.14,0:04:45.04,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,最大2回のコンビネーションジャンプ
Dialogue: 6,0:04:45.69,0:04:48.30,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,4回のジャンプと3回のスピン
Dialogue: 6,0:04:48.81,0:04:53.25,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,1回のステップシークエンス合10回の技を組み合わせて
Dialogue: 6,0:04:53.25,0:04:56.53,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,プログラムを構成し挑むのです
Dialogue: 6,0:04:56.53,0:04:59.73,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,全部転ばずにできたら1等?
Dialogue: 6,0:04:59.73,0:05:02.87,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,それがそう簡単ではありません
Dialogue: 6,0:05:02.87,0:05:04.28,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,見てください
Dialogue: 6,0:05:04.91,0:05:07.59,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,1番　申川りんなさん
Dialogue: 6,0:05:07.59,0:05:09.59,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,名港ウィンドFSC
Dialogue: 6,0:05:15.78,0:05:16.98,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,始まった
Dialogue: 6,0:05:27.36,0:05:30.77,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,もうすぐ跳びますよ　よく見ててください
Dialogue: 6,0:05:33.56,0:05:34.44,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,すごい
Dialogue: 6,0:05:36.85,0:05:38.21,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,今の3回転?
Dialogue: 6,0:05:38.21,0:05:40.15,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,3回転ルッツです
Dialogue: 6,0:05:40.15,0:05:41.69,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,ルッツっていうのは…
Dialogue: 6,0:05:41.69,0:05:43.48,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,ジャンプの種類です
Dialogue: 6,0:05:43.48,0:05:45.44,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,ジャンプは全部で6種類
Dialogue: 6,0:05:45.44,0:05:46.74,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,得点が高い順に
Dialogue: 6,0:05:47.06,0:05:48.03,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,アクセル
Dialogue: 6,0:05:48.03,0:05:48.70,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,ルッツ
Dialogue: 6,0:05:48.70,0:05:49.45,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,フリップ
Dialogue: 6,0:05:49.45,0:05:49.87,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,ループ
Dialogue: 6,0:05:49.87,0:05:50.43,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,サルコウ
Dialogue: 6,0:05:50.43,0:05:51.39,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,トウループ
Dialogue: 6,0:05:51.39,0:05:53.96,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,得点が高いジャンプは一般的に難しく
Dialogue: 6,0:05:53.96,0:05:56.77,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,失敗の可能性も高くなる
Dialogue: 6,0:05:56.77,0:06:00.59,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,よって　一番体力と集中力のある最初に
Dialogue: 6,0:06:00.59,0:06:03.46,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,その選手にとって一番難易度が高くて
Dialogue: 6,0:06:03.46,0:06:07.68,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,高得点を望める大技を持ってくるのが正攻法です
Dialogue: 6,0:06:07.68,0:06:12.36,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,ここを成功させると　一気に高得点の期待が高まる
Dialogue: 6,0:06:13.06,0:06:16.16,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,涼しい顔をしながらも見ているコーチは
Dialogue: 6,0:06:16.16,0:06:19.94,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,心の中でガッツポーズをしているはずです
Dialogue: 6,0:06:19.94,0:06:23.83,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,1番滑走くらいでメソメソしてて意味分かんねぇ
Dialogue: 6,0:06:24.35,0:06:27.43,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,1番滑走でガッツリ高得点出せんのは
Dialogue: 6,0:06:27.43,0:06:28.87,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,お前くらいだろうよ
Dialogue: 6,0:06:36.33,0:06:37.04,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,転んだ
Dialogue: 6,0:06:37.04,0:06:40.25,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,これがスケートの難しいところです
Dialogue: 6,0:06:40.25,0:06:43.48,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,高難易度のジャンプを成功させたからといって
Dialogue: 6,0:06:43.48,0:06:46.80,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,必ずしもそのあとがうまくいくとは限らない
Dialogue: 6,0:06:58.60,0:07:03.03,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,演技が進むにつれ　集中力も体力も落ちてくる
Dialogue: 6,0:07:03.03,0:07:06.52,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,当然それだけミスも増えてくるのです
Dialogue: 6,0:07:15.07,0:07:16.33,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,惜しい
Dialogue: 6,0:07:47.67,0:07:49.04,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,すごい
Dialogue: 6,0:07:49.04,0:07:51.62,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,ジャンプ　迫力あったなぁ
Dialogue: 6,0:07:51.94,0:07:54.96,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,すごくレベルの高い滑走でした
Dialogue: 6,0:07:56.00,0:07:58.62,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,テレビで見たことある所だ
Dialogue: 6,0:07:59.54,0:08:01.82,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,キスアンドクライという場所です
Dialogue: 6,0:08:01.82,0:08:04.71,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,あそこで　コーチと採点結果を待ちます
Dialogue: 6,0:08:05.06,0:08:08.42,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,小さな大会には設置されないことが多いので
Dialogue: 6,0:08:08.42,0:08:10.21,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,トップ選手だけが座れる
Dialogue: 6,0:08:10.21,0:08:12.22,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,特別な場所とも言えます
Dialogue: 6,0:08:12.63,0:08:15.15,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,うう… トリプルサルコウなんて
Dialogue: 6,0:08:15.15,0:08:17.69,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,練習で全然転ばないのに
Dialogue: 6,0:08:18.15,0:08:19.23,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,立派でした
Dialogue: 6,0:08:20.27,0:08:21.96,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,冒頭のトリプルルッツ
Dialogue: 6,0:08:22.65,0:08:24.95,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,この大会の一番最初のジャンプ
Dialogue: 6,0:08:25.79,0:08:29.26,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,緊張で押し潰されそうな局面でのあの完成度
Dialogue: 6,0:08:30.30,0:08:31.70,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,感動しました
Dialogue: 6,0:08:32.44,0:08:34.29,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,ありがとうございます
Dialogue: 6,0:08:34.29,0:08:35.20,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,りんな
Dialogue: 6,0:08:38.48,0:08:42.17,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,まずは1番滑走のおつとめご苦労　姫
Dialogue: 6,0:08:42.58,0:08:43.85,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,先生
Dialogue: 6,0:08:44.60,0:08:46.52,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,ホストの方のようですね
Dialogue: 6,0:08:46.86,0:08:50.21,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,ご心配なく　姫全員分ありますので
Dialogue: 6,0:08:50.81,0:08:52.54,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,申川さんの得点
Dialogue: 6,0:08:53.74,0:08:55.72,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,70.04
Dialogue: 6,0:08:59.69,0:09:01.10,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,大健闘です
Dialogue: 6,0:09:01.10,0:09:04.61,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,信じてるぜ　全日本行けるって
Dialogue: 6,0:09:08.11,0:09:10.30,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,70.04
Dialogue: 6,0:09:10.30,0:09:11.67,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,高いの
Dialogue: 6,0:09:11.67,0:09:15.37,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,1番滑走を考えたら　十分高いと言えます
Dialogue: 6,0:09:15.73,0:09:17.28,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,後続の選手たちに
Dialogue: 6,0:09:17.28,0:09:21.37,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,かなりのプレッシャーを与えることができる点数と言える
Dialogue: 6,0:09:21.78,0:09:24.24,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,今の子の点を上回るように
Dialogue: 6,0:09:24.24,0:09:26.63,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,みんな　頑張らないといけないんですね
Dialogue: 6,0:09:23.63,0:09:26.01,Top_JP,,0,0,0,,最終確認　問題ないです
Dialogue: 6,0:09:26.01,0:09:26.63,Top_JP,,0,0,0,,よし
Dialogue: 6,0:09:26.63,0:09:27.95,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,そうです
Dialogue: 6,0:09:27.95,0:09:30.73,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,そして　全員の演技が終わった時
Dialogue: 6,0:09:30.73,0:09:34.14,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,上位5名が　次の全日本に進める
Dialogue: 6,0:09:34.66,0:09:38.52,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,その座を守り続けられるか　奪い取られるか
Dialogue: 6,0:09:38.84,0:09:41.66,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,イス取りゲームの始まりです
Dialogue: 6,0:09:44.57,0:09:47.07,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,2番　穴熊咲希奈さん
Dialogue: 6,0:09:47.53,0:09:50.28,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,タクト豊橋FSC
Dialogue: 6,0:09:50.66,0:09:53.52,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,この子も5つの席を争うのか
Dialogue: 6,0:09:53.52,0:09:55.03,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,厳しいなぁ
Dialogue: 6,0:09:55.44,0:09:56.27,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,はい
Dialogue: 6,0:09:56.27,0:09:59.57,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,ですがこの世代は　圧倒的天才と言われる
Dialogue: 6,0:09:59.57,0:10:01.91,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,狼嵜光選手がいます
Dialogue: 6,0:10:01.91,0:10:04.42,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,狼嵜光
Dialogue: 6,0:10:04.42,0:10:08.92,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,その狼嵜選手が　この大会には出ていない
Dialogue: 6,0:10:09.44,0:10:12.79,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,今日は　トップに立つ大きなチャンス
Dialogue: 6,0:10:12.79,0:10:15.78,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,恐らく全員　意識しています
Dialogue: 6,0:10:48.51,0:10:50.40,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,光ちゃんがいない以上
Dialogue: 6,0:10:50.40,0:10:51.77,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,言い訳はできない
Dialogue: 6,0:10:52.30,0:10:55.30,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,今日は　私にもチャンスがある
Dialogue: 6,0:10:55.30,0:10:58.05,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,今の私じゃ無理かもしれないけど
Dialogue: 6,0:10:58.05,0:11:00.97,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,でも　奇跡が起きるかもしれないから
Dialogue: 6,0:11:00.97,0:11:03.56,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,この最初のジャンプ　必ず
Dialogue: 6,0:11:03.56,0:11:04.73,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,成功させる!
Dialogue: 6,0:11:08.11,0:11:09.11,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,よし!
Dialogue: 6,0:11:10.24,0:11:11.11,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,こらえた!
Dialogue: 6,0:11:15.63,0:11:17.16,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,できなかった
Dialogue: 6,0:11:17.81,0:11:20.18,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,あんなに練習したジャンプなのに
Dialogue: 6,0:11:25.48,0:11:29.13,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,切り替えろ　切り替えろ　取り戻すんだ
Dialogue: 6,0:11:29.13,0:11:33.80,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,諦めない　諦めない　次のジャンプを成功させる
Dialogue: 6,0:11:41.56,0:11:43.06,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,いつもの感覚を
Dialogue: 6,0:11:44.73,0:11:46.21,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,思い出せ
Dialogue: 6,0:11:49.56,0:11:51.70,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,最初のジャンプ転んだから
Dialogue: 6,0:11:51.70,0:11:53.44,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,もう点数が足りない
Dialogue: 6,0:11:54.44,0:11:57.45,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,全日本には届かないのかな
Dialogue: 6,0:11:58.66,0:12:01.91,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,そう思うと　力が抜けていく
Dialogue: 6,0:12:02.49,0:12:03.49,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,でも
Dialogue: 6,0:12:03.49,0:12:04.83,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,負けない!
Dialogue: 6,0:12:08.71,0:12:11.45,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,この指先　この角度
Dialogue: 6,0:12:13.14,0:12:15.53,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,この腕の振り下ろし方
Dialogue: 6,0:12:18.87,0:12:20.94,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,ワンポイントで入れたキック
Dialogue: 6,0:12:21.55,0:12:23.21,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,この表情
Dialogue: 6,0:12:23.21,0:12:24.14,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,1秒
Dialogue: 6,0:12:24.14,0:12:25.33,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,1秒
Dialogue: 6,0:12:25.33,0:12:26.27,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,1秒
Dialogue: 6,0:12:26.27,0:12:27.56,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,1秒に
Dialogue: 6,0:12:27.92,0:12:30.52,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,私たちの日々が詰まっている!
Dialogue: 6,0:12:32.25,0:12:35.57,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,失敗の数で　結果が見えたとしても
Dialogue: 6,0:12:36.38,0:12:39.94,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,あの時間を見失いたく　ない!
Dialogue: 6,0:12:41.47,0:12:44.62,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,先生と積み上げた1秒は
Dialogue: 6,0:12:45.05,0:12:47.12,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,最後まで私が
Dialogue: 6,0:12:47.69,0:12:48.75,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,私が
Dialogue: 6,0:12:49.50,0:12:50.54,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,私が
Dialogue: 6,0:12:55.72,0:12:57.13,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,守るんだ!
Dialogue: 6,0:13:15.05,0:13:18.30,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,よく　心が折れずに滑りきりました
Dialogue: 6,0:13:18.30,0:13:18.90,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,え?
Dialogue: 6,0:13:19.36,0:13:22.74,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,最初の難度の高いジャンプに失敗すると
Dialogue: 6,0:13:22.74,0:13:26.16,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,成功した者とは　大きな差が出てしまう
Dialogue: 6,0:13:26.16,0:13:28.91,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,それでも　心折れずに
Dialogue: 6,0:13:28.91,0:13:30.46,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,取り返そうと頑張っていた
Dialogue: 6,0:13:31.28,0:13:34.46,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,この子は　連続ジャンプが単独になってしまったので
Dialogue: 6,0:13:34.46,0:13:38.46,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,より難しい連続ジャンプを　後半に跳び直した
Dialogue: 6,0:13:38.46,0:13:40.72,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,すごい粘り強さです
Dialogue: 6,0:13:40.72,0:13:43.72,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,演技の途中で変更するんですか?
Dialogue: 6,0:13:43.72,0:13:47.22,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,選手とコーチは　そこまで想定します
Dialogue: 6,0:13:47.22,0:13:49.23,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,時間は3分しかない
Dialogue: 6,0:13:49.23,0:13:52.12,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,その間にできることをひたすら考え
Dialogue: 6,0:13:52.12,0:13:55.21,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,あらゆる状況に対応すべく準備をし
Dialogue: 6,0:13:55.21,0:13:56.48,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,挑むのです
Dialogue: 6,0:13:56.48,0:13:57.77,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,そうか
Dialogue: 6,0:13:57.77,0:14:01.20,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,それで司君も　毎日あんなに遅くまで
Dialogue: 6,0:14:01.70,0:14:03.99,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,離洲くるみさんの得点
Dialogue: 6,0:14:03.99,0:14:06.24,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,62.43
Dialogue: 6,0:14:06.62,0:14:08.02,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,現在の順位は
Dialogue: 6,0:14:08.02,0:14:09.34,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,第4位です
Dialogue: 6,0:14:09.87,0:14:12.21,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,厳しい世界だなぁ
Dialogue: 6,0:14:12.21,0:14:17.09,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,そういえば　お母さんと前に話したことがあった気がする
Dialogue: 6,0:14:20.46,0:14:22.72,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,同じことばっかりしてる
Dialogue: 6,0:14:22.72,0:14:23.84,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,そうね
Dialogue: 6,0:14:24.40,0:14:25.65,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,どうして?
Dialogue: 6,0:14:25.65,0:14:29.10,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,氷の上はね　とても不安定な所なの
Dialogue: 6,0:14:29.61,0:14:31.81,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,滑りやすいだけじゃない
Dialogue: 6,0:14:31.81,0:14:33.91,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,きれいに見える氷でも
Dialogue: 6,0:14:33.91,0:14:37.30,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,誰かが滑ったあとだと　小さな穴が開いていたり
Dialogue: 6,0:14:37.30,0:14:39.02,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,デコボコがあったり
Dialogue: 6,0:14:39.02,0:14:42.61,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,だから　何度も何度も練習するの
Dialogue: 6,0:14:42.61,0:14:45.03,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,何があっても転ばないように
Dialogue: 6,0:14:45.03,0:14:47.95,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,きれいにバランスを取っていられるように
Dialogue: 6,0:14:49.11,0:14:50.74,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,大変そう
Dialogue: 6,0:14:50.74,0:14:51.92,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,そうね
Dialogue: 6,0:14:53.29,0:14:58.02,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,でも… だから　とっても美しいんだよ
Dialogue: 6,0:15:01.13,0:15:03.59,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,続いて　海月わかさん
Dialogue: 6,0:15:03.59,0:15:05.10,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,熱海SC
Dialogue: 6,0:15:06.29,0:15:07.80,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,頑張れー!
Dialogue: 6,0:15:17.31,0:15:18.19,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,1位は?
Dialogue: 6,0:15:18.19,0:15:19.73,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,まだ最初の子だよ
Dialogue: 6,0:15:19.73,0:15:22.94,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,1番滑走で70点出してるからなぁ
Dialogue: 6,0:15:23.99,0:15:27.20,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,やっぱり　ノービスの子たちってすごい
Dialogue: 6,0:15:30.41,0:15:33.23,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,補給食のバナナおいしー
Dialogue: 6,0:15:33.23,0:15:34.90,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,座って食べて
Dialogue: 6,0:15:34.90,0:15:36.62,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,あ… はい…
Dialogue: 6,0:15:37.71,0:15:40.20,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,狼嵜選手がいない大会
Dialogue: 6,0:15:40.20,0:15:42.80,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,みんなが優勝を狙いに来ている
Dialogue: 6,0:15:43.14,0:15:45.18,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,海月和香さんの得点
Dialogue: 6,0:15:45.18,0:15:47.31,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,49.86
Dialogue: 6,0:15:47.31,0:15:49.80,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,現在の順位は　第6位です
Dialogue: 6,0:15:51.59,0:15:52.93,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,ごめんなさい
Dialogue: 6,0:15:52.93,0:15:55.12,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,届かなかったか
Dialogue: 6,0:15:55.12,0:15:58.44,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,やっぱり近くにリンクのないハンデは大きい
Dialogue: 6,0:15:58.87,0:16:02.22,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,とは言え　これ以上移動時間を増やすのは
Dialogue: 6,0:16:02.22,0:16:04.50,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,親御さんの負担が大きすぎる
Dialogue: 6,0:16:06.26,0:16:08.47,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,顔がまたゼリーみたいになってる
Dialogue: 6,0:16:09.73,0:16:13.23,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,車で何度も名古屋まで送ってくれたのに
Dialogue: 6,0:16:13.23,0:16:16.81,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,先生と全日本ノービス　行きたかったのに
Dialogue: 6,0:16:19.98,0:16:24.42,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,続いて炉場愛花さん　愛西ライドFSC
Dialogue: 6,0:16:25.08,0:16:27.17,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,次に行けるイスは5個
Dialogue: 6,0:16:27.67,0:16:32.31,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,今　5位の点数は牛川四葉ちゃんの53.77
Dialogue: 6,0:16:32.31,0:16:35.44,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,でもそんなんじゃ　イスは絶対守れない
Dialogue: 6,0:16:35.83,0:16:38.94,Text_JP,,700,0,0,,目指すは　1位の申川りんなちゃんの得点
Dialogue: 6,0:16:39.34,0:16:40.94,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,70.04
Dialogue: 6,0:16:41.24,0:16:43.26,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,頑張れ　愛花
Dialogue: 6,0:16:46.09,0:16:47.49,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,まず笑顔
Dialogue: 6,0:16:48.50,0:16:51.10,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,まるで見ている人も踊りたくなるような
Dialogue: 6,0:16:51.10,0:16:54.12,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,楽しそうなステップで一気に引き付ける
Dialogue: 6,0:17:01.79,0:17:03.88,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,すごく踊れる子だ
Dialogue: 6,0:17:07.45,0:17:10.62,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,最初のジャンプ　ダブルアクセル
Dialogue: 6,0:17:19.81,0:17:22.50,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,続けて　ダブルフリップ
Dialogue: 6,0:17:24.48,0:17:25.77,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,よし
Dialogue: 6,0:17:27.23,0:17:30.57,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,今のは　2回転?
Dialogue: 6,0:17:30.57,0:17:35.69,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,これは… わざと最強ジャンプを最初にセットしていない
Dialogue: 6,0:17:42.71,0:17:44.63,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,ウチの勝負はここから
Dialogue: 6,0:17:45.22,0:17:48.51,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,後半2つのジャンプは　得点が1.1倍
Dialogue: 6,0:17:48.51,0:17:51.89,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,そこに　一番大技のジャンプを持っていく
Dialogue: 6,0:17:52.23,0:17:53.80,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,けどリスクも高い
Dialogue: 6,0:17:53.80,0:17:55.55,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,もし失敗すれば
Dialogue: 6,0:17:55.55,0:17:58.50,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,1.1倍の得点も得られないどころか
Dialogue: 6,0:17:58.50,0:18:00.18,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,リカバリーのチャンスもない
Dialogue: 6,0:18:00.63,0:18:02.10,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,まさにギャンブル
Dialogue: 6,0:18:02.66,0:18:03.77,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,大ばくち
Dialogue: 6,0:18:05.54,0:18:08.85,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,私は体力がなくて　後半が苦手だから
Dialogue: 6,0:18:08.85,0:18:11.65,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,やりたくても　その作戦には挑めなかった
Dialogue: 6,0:18:12.21,0:18:15.45,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,優勝狙いの　本気の挑戦だ
Dialogue: 6,0:18:28.67,0:18:30.41,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,う… やっば…
Dialogue: 6,0:18:31.16,0:18:34.13,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,あと3回　やっぱり心配だ
Dialogue: 6,0:18:34.13,0:18:36.29,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,最後のジャンプは単独にしよう
Dialogue: 6,0:18:36.29,0:18:38.74,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,次のジャンプで　コンビネーションジャンプを
Dialogue: 6,0:18:41.31,0:18:43.14,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,コンビネーションをミスった
Dialogue: 6,0:18:43.70,0:18:46.20,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,残り2つで取り返すしかない
Dialogue: 6,0:18:47.79,0:18:49.26,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,足がキツい
Dialogue: 6,0:18:49.75,0:18:52.74,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,ここからコンビネーション　2つなんて
Dialogue: 6,0:18:52.74,0:18:54.62,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,ウチのバカ
Dialogue: 6,0:18:54.62,0:18:58.03,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,前半に跳んでいたら　絶対成功してたのに
Dialogue: 6,0:18:58.03,0:19:00.29,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,どうして挑戦するなんて
Dialogue: 6,0:19:01.56,0:19:02.98,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,何言ってんだよ
Dialogue: 6,0:19:04.68,0:19:07.92,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,挑戦できるお前は　カッケーやつだよ
Dialogue: 6,0:19:09.85,0:19:12.96,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,そうだ　挑戦者は私だ
Dialogue: 6,0:19:12.96,0:19:14.89,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,自分に賭けられないやつが
Dialogue: 6,0:19:14.89,0:19:18.09,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,運命に勝てるわけがないんだ
Dialogue: 6,0:19:29.67,0:19:30.62,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,行くぞ
Dialogue: 6,0:19:38.62,0:19:42.09,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,うおおお　ラスト2つが1.1倍
Dialogue: 6,0:19:54.51,0:19:56.03,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,かわいい
Dialogue: 6,0:19:56.03,0:19:57.84,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,鳥肌立ったぁ
Dialogue: 6,0:19:58.40,0:20:02.60,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,選手の個性が光る　愛西ライドらしい演技でした
Dialogue: 6,0:20:02.60,0:20:04.60,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,愛花っ
Dialogue: 6,0:20:04.60,0:20:07.66,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,ヤバい　ヤバい　ヤバい　エッジケースつけてないから
Dialogue: 6,0:20:07.66,0:20:10.56,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,ウチ　刃物振り回す人になってるから
Dialogue: 6,0:20:12.96,0:20:14.84,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,炉場愛花さんの得点
Dialogue: 6,0:20:15.75,0:20:17.86,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,72.62
Dialogue: 6,0:20:17.86,0:20:21.26,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,現在の順位は　第1位です
Dialogue: 6,0:20:22.12,0:20:24.62,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,順位が入れ替わった
Dialogue: 6,0:20:26.87,0:20:28.50,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,よおしっ
Dialogue: 6,0:20:36.51,0:20:37.84,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,よくやったぞ
Dialogue: 6,0:20:38.28,0:20:40.34,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,いやぁ　ホントあの角度良かった
Dialogue: 6,0:20:57.57,0:20:58.75,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,四葉
Dialogue: 6,0:21:01.35,0:21:02.96,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,おつとめ　ご苦労さま
Dialogue: 6,0:21:11.39,0:21:13.07,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,大丈夫ですよ　先生
Dialogue: 6,0:21:14.86,0:21:20.09,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,私は　誰よりも長く慎一郎先生と氷の上に乗ってきました
Dialogue: 6,0:21:20.82,0:21:24.35,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,名港ウィンドが最強だってことを証明するためにも
Dialogue: 6,0:21:25.54,0:21:29.51,Text_JP,,0,0,0,,私が　この大会の金メダルを持って帰ります
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Comment,,0,0,0,,---------------TEXT_CN---------------
Dialogue: 7,0:00:03.67,0:00:06.81,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,为什么加护先生每次都给我吃剩下的
Dialogue: 7,0:00:09.03,0:00:10.99,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,真是受够了
Dialogue: 7,0:00:10.99,0:00:14.79,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,只要没抽到1号  妈妈和司就都能赶上了
Dialogue: 7,0:00:15.18,0:00:16.08,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,司
Dialogue: 7,0:00:18.62,0:00:20.33,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,抱歉  没事吧
Dialogue: 7,0:00:20.33,0:00:22.17,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,不… 不是的  是这个
Dialogue: 7,0:00:22.89,0:00:25.00,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,对… 对… 对… 对不起  我没事
Dialogue: 7,0:00:25.85,0:00:26.22,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 7,0:00:26.22,0:00:28.42,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,找我们家凛奈有什么事吗
Dialogue: 7,0:00:28.80,0:00:30.47,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,啊  那个
Dialogue: 7,0:00:30.47,0:00:34.89,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,我是担任名港助理教练的雉多辉也
Dialogue: 7,0:00:36.05,0:00:39.02,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,我是Lux东山的明浦路司
Dialogue: 7,0:00:39.02,0:00:42.78,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,抱歉  因为看到她好像在哭所以就
Dialogue: 7,0:00:43.61,0:00:46.60,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,你在哭？真是受不了啊
Dialogue: 7,0:00:47.32,0:00:48.33,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 7,0:00:48.69,0:00:49.45,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 7,0:00:52.53,0:00:54.74,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,第一个出场啊
Dialogue: 7,0:00:55.41,0:00:56.32,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 7,0:02:31.48,0:02:33.01,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,跳起来了这么厉害
Dialogue: 7,0:02:34.55,0:02:36.18,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,好想回去
Dialogue: 7,0:02:37.47,0:02:40.04,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,完全不知道该往哪里看
Dialogue: 7,0:02:40.36,0:02:41.97,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,比赛已经开始了吗
Dialogue: 7,0:02:41.97,0:02:43.26,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,啊… 那个
Dialogue: 7,0:02:43.62,0:02:48.28,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,听着像是还在练习的样子
Dialogue: 7,0:02:48.28,0:02:49.93,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,什么时候开始?
Dialogue: 7,0:02:49.93,0:02:51.48,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,我看看
Dialogue: 7,0:02:53.91,0:02:55.24,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,你很好奇吧
Dialogue: 7,0:02:55.91,0:02:57.74,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,关于阿司的事情
Dialogue: 7,0:02:57.74,0:02:58.74,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,诶?
Dialogue: 7,0:02:58.74,0:03:01.48,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,我这里没问题  你去看看他吧
Dialogue: 7,0:03:06.83,0:03:08.38,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,我们不是约好了吗
Dialogue: 7,0:03:08.68,0:03:12.21,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,等稍微好一点了就和羊三个人一起去看比赛
Dialogue: 7,0:03:13.21,0:03:15.74,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,我很期待
Dialogue: 7,0:03:15.74,0:03:17.39,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,你能在那个时候教会我
Dialogue: 7,0:03:17.79,0:03:20.34,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,花样滑冰详细的规则
Dialogue: 7,0:03:24.11,0:03:26.51,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,爸爸也不知道  去问问其他人吧
Dialogue: 7,0:03:30.06,0:03:31.65,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,那个不好意思
Dialogue: 7,0:03:32.29,0:03:35.40,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,花样滑冰比赛该怎么看呢
Dialogue: 7,0:03:35.98,0:03:39.22,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,诶？第… 第一次看吗
Dialogue: 7,0:03:39.22,0:03:42.51,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,是的  虽然我就算看不懂规则也能看得很开心
Dialogue: 7,0:03:42.51,0:03:44.75,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,但还是希望这孩子能有所收获
Dialogue: 7,0:03:44.75,0:03:45.64,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 7,0:03:47.97,0:03:50.84,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,话是这么说  可规则实在复杂
Dialogue: 7,0:03:50.84,0:03:53.78,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,想要让小孩子也听明白  确实…
Dialogue: 7,0:03:53.78,0:03:56.20,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,有没有那种  第一次看也能懂的
Dialogue: 7,0:03:56.20,0:03:59.01,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,像是看点指南的东西
Dialogue: 7,0:03:59.01,0:04:00.81,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,能让对花样滑冰一无所知的小学生
Dialogue: 7,0:04:00.81,0:04:03.51,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,也能听懂这复杂规则的方法…?
Dialogue: 7,0:04:05.17,0:04:07.36,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,不用了  你看人家都困扰了
Dialogue: 7,0:04:07.36,0:04:08.98,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,才没有呢
Dialogue: 7,0:04:09.38,0:04:10.39,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 7,0:04:10.98,0:04:12.17,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,当… 当然
Dialogue: 7,0:04:12.17,0:04:17.14,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,欣赏动作美和艺术表现力固然是一大享受
Dialogue: 7,0:04:17.14,0:04:18.47,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,但除此之外
Dialogue: 7,0:04:18.47,0:04:23.49,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,我觉得也可以从「赌」的角度去欣赏这门运动
Dialogue: 7,0:04:24.01,0:04:25.11,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,赌?
Dialogue: 7,0:04:25.11,0:04:26.50,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,赌博…
Dialogue: 7,0:04:26.50,0:04:29.06,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,对于普通人来说
Dialogue: 7,0:04:29.06,0:04:31.50,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,冰面与其说是光滑  不如说是又黏又滑
Dialogue: 7,0:04:31.50,0:04:35.88,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,经常会跌倒  没有绝对的稳定
Dialogue: 7,0:04:36.36,0:04:39.04,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,在这种情况下
Dialogue: 7,0:04:39.04,0:04:42.14,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,少年A组的选手各有三分钟的表演时间
Dialogue: 7,0:04:42.14,0:04:45.04,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,最多进行2次连跳
Dialogue: 7,0:04:45.69,0:04:48.30,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,4次单跳以及3次旋转
Dialogue: 7,0:04:48.81,0:04:53.25,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,加上1次接续步总计10个动作
Dialogue: 7,0:04:53.25,0:04:56.53,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,组合编排成节目并发起挑战
Dialogue: 7,0:04:56.53,0:04:59.73,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,如果一次都没有摔倒就是第一名?
Dialogue: 7,0:04:59.73,0:05:02.87,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,没有这么简单
Dialogue: 7,0:05:02.87,0:05:04.28,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,请看
Dialogue: 7,0:05:04.91,0:05:07.59,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,1号  申川凛奈选手
Dialogue: 7,0:05:07.59,0:05:09.59,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,名港Wind FSC
Dialogue: 7,0:05:15.78,0:05:16.98,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,开始了
Dialogue: 7,0:05:27.36,0:05:30.77,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,马上就要起跳了  请仔细观看
Dialogue: 7,0:05:33.56,0:05:34.44,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 7,0:05:36.85,0:05:38.21,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,刚刚那是3周跳?
Dialogue: 7,0:05:38.21,0:05:40.15,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,是勾手3周跳
Dialogue: 7,0:05:40.15,0:05:41.69,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,勾手是…
Dialogue: 7,0:05:41.69,0:05:43.48,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,是跳跃的一种
Dialogue: 7,0:05:43.48,0:05:45.44,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,跳跃一共有6种
Dialogue: 7,0:05:45.44,0:05:46.74,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,得分由高到低分别是
Dialogue: 7,0:05:47.06,0:05:48.03,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,阿克塞尔
Dialogue: 7,0:05:48.03,0:05:48.70,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,勾手
Dialogue: 7,0:05:48.70,0:05:49.45,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,后内点冰
Dialogue: 7,0:05:49.45,0:05:49.87,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,后外结环
Dialogue: 7,0:05:49.87,0:05:50.43,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,后内结环
Dialogue: 7,0:05:50.43,0:05:51.39,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,后外点冰
Dialogue: 7,0:05:51.39,0:05:53.96,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,得分越高的跳跃一般来说会越难
Dialogue: 7,0:05:53.96,0:05:56.77,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,失败的可能性也会越高
Dialogue: 7,0:05:56.77,0:06:00.59,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,所以选手一般都会
Dialogue: 7,0:06:00.59,0:06:03.46,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,把难度最大得分最高的动作
Dialogue: 7,0:06:03.46,0:06:07.68,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,放在刚开始自己体力和专注度最好的时候
Dialogue: 7,0:06:07.68,0:06:12.36,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,如果在这里成功了  获得高分的几率就会大大提升
Dialogue: 7,0:06:13.06,0:06:16.16,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,虽然教练们看着一副冷静的样子
Dialogue: 7,0:06:16.16,0:06:19.94,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,但他们心里也一定在为选手加油
Dialogue: 7,0:06:19.94,0:06:23.83,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,完全不理解为什么作为第一位登场的选手会哭
Dialogue: 7,0:06:24.35,0:06:27.43,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,你可能是唯一一个能在第一位登场
Dialogue: 7,0:06:27.43,0:06:28.87,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,并且获得高分的选手
Dialogue: 7,0:06:36.33,0:06:37.04,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,摔倒了
Dialogue: 7,0:06:37.04,0:06:40.25,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,这就是滑冰的困难之处
Dialogue: 7,0:06:40.25,0:06:43.48,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,就算难度最高的跳跃成功了
Dialogue: 7,0:06:43.48,0:06:46.80,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,也不代表后面会一帆风顺
Dialogue: 7,0:06:58.60,0:07:03.03,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,随着表演持续  体力和专注度都会下滑
Dialogue: 7,0:07:03.03,0:07:06.52,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,失误也理所应当会变多
Dialogue: 7,0:07:15.07,0:07:16.33,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,好可惜
Dialogue: 7,0:07:47.67,0:07:49.04,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 7,0:07:49.04,0:07:51.62,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,跳跃很有气势啊
Dialogue: 7,0:07:51.94,0:07:54.96,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,是水平非常高的演出
Dialogue: 7,0:07:56.00,0:07:58.62,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,那个地方我在电视上看到过
Dialogue: 7,0:07:59.54,0:08:01.82,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,那里是kiss&cry区
Dialogue: 7,0:08:01.82,0:08:04.71,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,选手在那里  和教练一起等待结果
Dialogue: 7,0:08:05.06,0:08:08.42,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,小型比赛大多都没有
Dialogue: 7,0:08:08.42,0:08:10.21,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,可以说是只有顶尖选手
Dialogue: 7,0:08:10.21,0:08:12.22,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,才能坐的地方了
Dialogue: 7,0:08:12.63,0:08:15.15,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,呜呜… 后内结环3周跳
Dialogue: 7,0:08:15.15,0:08:17.69,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,明明练习时完全没摔过
Dialogue: 7,0:08:18.15,0:08:19.23,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,你滑得很棒
Dialogue: 7,0:08:20.27,0:08:21.96,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,最开始的勾手3周跳
Dialogue: 7,0:08:22.65,0:08:24.95,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,作为这场比赛的第一个跳跃
Dialogue: 7,0:08:25.79,0:08:29.26,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,在如此紧张的形况下还能有这样的完成度
Dialogue: 7,0:08:30.30,0:08:31.70,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,我很感动
Dialogue: 7,0:08:32.44,0:08:34.29,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,非常感谢
Dialogue: 7,0:08:34.29,0:08:35.20,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,凛奈
Dialogue: 7,0:08:38.48,0:08:42.17,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,第一个出场辛苦了  公主殿下
Dialogue: 7,0:08:42.58,0:08:43.85,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,教练
Dialogue: 7,0:08:44.60,0:08:46.52,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,跟牛郎一样啊
Dialogue: 7,0:08:46.86,0:08:50.21,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,不用担心  所有公主我都有准备
Dialogue: 7,0:08:50.81,0:08:52.54,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,申川选手的得分是
Dialogue: 7,0:08:53.74,0:08:55.72,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,70.04
Dialogue: 7,0:08:59.69,0:09:01.10,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,很高的分数
Dialogue: 7,0:09:01.10,0:09:04.61,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,我相信你  一定可以进全日本锦标赛
Dialogue: 7,0:09:08.11,0:09:10.30,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,70.04
Dialogue: 7,0:09:10.30,0:09:11.67,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,很高吗
Dialogue: 7,0:09:11.67,0:09:15.37,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,考虑到第一个出场  可以说是很高的分数了
Dialogue: 7,0:09:15.73,0:09:17.28,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,可以说这个分数
Dialogue: 7,0:09:17.28,0:09:21.37,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,会给后面出场的选手们很大的压力
Dialogue: 7,0:09:21.78,0:09:24.24,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,为了超过这个分数
Dialogue: 7,0:09:24.24,0:09:26.63,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,选手们  必须加倍努力了啊
Dialogue: 7,0:09:23.63,0:09:26.01,Top_SC,,0,0,0,,最终确认  没有问题
Dialogue: 7,0:09:26.01,0:09:26.63,Top_SC,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 7,0:09:26.63,0:09:27.95,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 7,0:09:27.95,0:09:30.73,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,然后  所有选手都表演完后
Dialogue: 7,0:09:30.73,0:09:34.14,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,只有得分最高的5人  可以进入全日本锦标赛
Dialogue: 7,0:09:34.66,0:09:38.52,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,守住这个位置  或是被别人抢走
Dialogue: 7,0:09:38.84,0:09:41.66,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,抢椅子游戏已经开始了
Dialogue: 7,0:09:44.57,0:09:47.07,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,2号  穴熊咲希奈选手
Dialogue: 7,0:09:47.53,0:09:50.28,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,Takt丰桥 FSC
Dialogue: 7,0:09:50.66,0:09:53.52,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,这孩子也要抢那5个位置吗
Dialogue: 7,0:09:53.52,0:09:55.03,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,真辛苦啊
Dialogue: 7,0:09:55.44,0:09:56.27,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 7,0:09:56.27,0:09:59.57,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,但是她们这一代  有一名被称为最强天才的
Dialogue: 7,0:09:59.57,0:10:01.91,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,狼崎光选手
Dialogue: 7,0:10:01.91,0:10:04.42,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,狼崎光
Dialogue: 7,0:10:04.42,0:10:08.92,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,那名狼崎光选手  没有出席这次大赛
Dialogue: 7,0:10:09.44,0:10:12.79,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,所以今天  是拿冠军的好机会
Dialogue: 7,0:10:12.79,0:10:15.78,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,恐怕所有人  都会来争抢金牌
Dialogue: 7,0:10:48.51,0:10:50.40,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,小光不在
Dialogue: 7,0:10:50.40,0:10:51.77,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,就没有任何借口
Dialogue: 7,0:10:52.30,0:10:55.30,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,今天  我也有机会夺冠
Dialogue: 7,0:10:55.30,0:10:58.05,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,现在我可能实力不够
Dialogue: 7,0:10:58.05,0:11:00.97,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,但是  万一有奇迹发生了呢
Dialogue: 7,0:11:00.97,0:11:03.56,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,这第一跳  我一定要
Dialogue: 7,0:11:03.56,0:11:04.73,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,成功!
Dialogue: 7,0:11:08.11,0:11:09.11,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,好!
Dialogue: 7,0:11:10.24,0:11:11.11,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,撑住了!
Dialogue: 7,0:11:15.63,0:11:17.16,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,摔倒了
Dialogue: 7,0:11:17.81,0:11:20.18,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,练习了那么多次的跳跃
Dialogue: 7,0:11:25.48,0:11:29.13,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,稳住情绪  稳住情绪  之后再挽回
Dialogue: 7,0:11:29.13,0:11:33.80,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,不能放弃  不能放弃  下个跳跃一定要成功
Dialogue: 7,0:11:41.56,0:11:43.06,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,练习时的感觉
Dialogue: 7,0:11:44.73,0:11:46.21,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,快点找回来
Dialogue: 7,0:11:49.56,0:11:51.70,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,第一个跳跃摔倒
Dialogue: 7,0:11:51.70,0:11:53.44,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,分数已经不够了
Dialogue: 7,0:11:54.44,0:11:57.45,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,已经无缘全日本锦标赛了吗
Dialogue: 7,0:11:58.66,0:12:01.91,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,一想到这  全身都没有力气
Dialogue: 7,0:12:02.49,0:12:03.49,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 7,0:12:03.49,0:12:04.83,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,我不能输!
Dialogue: 7,0:12:08.71,0:12:11.45,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,这个指尖  这个角度
Dialogue: 7,0:12:13.14,0:12:15.53,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,这样挥舞手臂
Dialogue: 7,0:12:18.87,0:12:20.94,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,作为亮点加入的踢腿
Dialogue: 7,0:12:21.55,0:12:23.21,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,这个表情
Dialogue: 7,0:12:23.21,0:12:24.14,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,每一秒
Dialogue: 7,0:12:24.14,0:12:25.33,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,每一秒
Dialogue: 7,0:12:25.33,0:12:26.27,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,每一秒
Dialogue: 7,0:12:26.27,0:12:27.56,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,每一秒都
Dialogue: 7,0:12:27.92,0:12:30.52,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,融入了我们的一切!
Dialogue: 7,0:12:32.25,0:12:35.57,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,数次的失误  即便已能看到结果
Dialogue: 7,0:12:36.38,0:12:39.94,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,但我不要让练习的时间  化为乌有!
Dialogue: 7,0:12:41.47,0:12:44.62,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,和教练一起努力的每一秒
Dialogue: 7,0:12:45.05,0:12:47.12,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,现在我要
Dialogue: 7,0:12:47.69,0:12:48.75,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,我要
Dialogue: 7,0:12:49.50,0:12:50.54,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,我要
Dialogue: 7,0:12:55.72,0:12:57.13,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,守护到最后!
Dialogue: 7,0:13:15.05,0:13:18.30,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,真坚强啊  没有气馁滑到最后
Dialogue: 7,0:13:18.30,0:13:18.90,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,嗯?
Dialogue: 7,0:13:19.36,0:13:22.74,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,如果最初高难度的跳跃失败了
Dialogue: 7,0:13:22.74,0:13:26.16,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,会和成功的选手  拉开很大的差距
Dialogue: 7,0:13:26.16,0:13:28.91,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,即使如此  她们也没有放弃
Dialogue: 7,0:13:28.91,0:13:30.46,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,努力在后面的表演挽回
Dialogue: 7,0:13:31.28,0:13:34.46,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,这名选手  把连跳做成了单跳
Dialogue: 7,0:13:34.46,0:13:38.46,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,所以在后半  用更难的连跳重跳了一遍
Dialogue: 7,0:13:38.46,0:13:40.72,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,有很强的毅力
Dialogue: 7,0:13:40.72,0:13:43.72,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,在表演途中更换动作吗?
Dialogue: 7,0:13:43.72,0:13:47.22,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,选手和教练  连这些都会规划好
Dialogue: 7,0:13:47.22,0:13:49.23,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,时间只有短短3分钟
Dialogue: 7,0:13:49.23,0:13:52.12,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,把这段时间内能做到的事情考虑周全
Dialogue: 7,0:13:52.12,0:13:55.21,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,所有可能发生的意外全都想好对策
Dialogue: 7,0:13:55.21,0:13:56.48,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,然后再去挑战
Dialogue: 7,0:13:56.48,0:13:57.77,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 7,0:13:57.77,0:14:01.20,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,所以阿司  每天都研究到那么晚
Dialogue: 7,0:14:01.70,0:14:03.99,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,离洲胡桃选手的得分是
Dialogue: 7,0:14:03.99,0:14:06.24,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,62.43
Dialogue: 7,0:14:06.62,0:14:08.02,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,现在的排名是
Dialogue: 7,0:14:08.02,0:14:09.34,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,第4名
Dialogue: 7,0:14:09.87,0:14:12.21,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,真是残酷的世界啊
Dialogue: 7,0:14:12.21,0:14:17.09,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,对了  妈妈以前好像说过
Dialogue: 7,0:14:20.46,0:14:22.72,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,一直在做同一个动作
Dialogue: 7,0:14:22.72,0:14:23.84,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 7,0:14:24.40,0:14:25.65,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,为什么?
Dialogue: 7,0:14:25.65,0:14:29.10,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,冰面上  非常不稳定哦
Dialogue: 7,0:14:29.61,0:14:31.81,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,不只是很滑
Dialogue: 7,0:14:31.81,0:14:33.91,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,就算看上去很平整
Dialogue: 7,0:14:33.91,0:14:37.30,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,别人滑过之后  就会出现小洞
Dialogue: 7,0:14:37.30,0:14:39.02,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,变得凹凸不平
Dialogue: 7,0:14:39.02,0:14:42.61,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,所以才要  一次又一次地练习
Dialogue: 7,0:14:42.61,0:14:45.03,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,为了不管遇到什么情况都不会摔倒
Dialogue: 7,0:14:45.03,0:14:47.95,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,为了取得完美的平衡
Dialogue: 7,0:14:49.11,0:14:50.74,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,真不容易
Dialogue: 7,0:14:50.74,0:14:51.92,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 7,0:14:53.29,0:14:58.02,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,但是… 所以才会  如此赏心悦目
Dialogue: 7,0:15:01.13,0:15:03.59,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,下一位是  海月和香选手
Dialogue: 7,0:15:03.59,0:15:05.10,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,热海SC
Dialogue: 7,0:15:06.29,0:15:07.80,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,加油!
Dialogue: 7,0:15:17.31,0:15:18.19,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,第一名是?
Dialogue: 7,0:15:18.19,0:15:19.73,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,还是第一个滑的选手
Dialogue: 7,0:15:19.73,0:15:22.94,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,第一个出场就滑出了70分啊
Dialogue: 7,0:15:23.99,0:15:27.20,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,果然  少年组都好厉害
Dialogue: 7,0:15:30.41,0:15:33.23,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,营养香蕉真美味
Dialogue: 7,0:15:33.23,0:15:34.90,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,给我坐下好好吃
Dialogue: 7,0:15:34.90,0:15:36.62,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,啊… 是…
Dialogue: 7,0:15:37.71,0:15:40.20,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,狼崎光选手不参加
Dialogue: 7,0:15:40.20,0:15:42.80,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,所有人都是冲着冠军来的
Dialogue: 7,0:15:43.14,0:15:45.18,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,海月和香选手的得分是
Dialogue: 7,0:15:45.18,0:15:47.31,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,49.86
Dialogue: 7,0:15:47.31,0:15:49.80,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,现在的排名是  第6名
Dialogue: 7,0:15:51.59,0:15:52.93,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 7,0:15:52.93,0:15:55.12,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,还是做不到吗
Dialogue: 7,0:15:55.12,0:15:58.44,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,果然家附近没有冰场还是很吃力啊
Dialogue: 7,0:15:58.87,0:16:02.22,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,话虽如此  可要是再增加出勤次数
Dialogue: 7,0:16:02.22,0:16:04.50,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,父母的负担就太大了
Dialogue: 7,0:16:06.26,0:16:08.47,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,她的脸又变得像果冻一样了
Dialogue: 7,0:16:09.73,0:16:13.23,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,明明一次又一次开车送我去到名古屋
Dialogue: 7,0:16:13.23,0:16:16.81,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,明明那么想和教练一起去到全日本少年组的
Dialogue: 7,0:16:19.98,0:16:24.42,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,下一位  炉场爱花选手  爱西Ride FSC
Dialogue: 7,0:16:25.08,0:16:27.17,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,能晋级的位置有五个
Dialogue: 7,0:16:27.67,0:16:32.31,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,现在第五名的分数是牛川四叶的53.77
Dialogue: 7,0:16:32.31,0:16:35.44,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,但这个分数绝对守不住位置
Dialogue: 7,0:16:35.83,0:16:38.94,Text_SC,,700,0,0,,目标是  第一名申川凛奈的分数
Dialogue: 7,0:16:39.34,0:16:40.94,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,70.04
Dialogue: 7,0:16:41.24,0:16:43.26,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,加油  爱花
Dialogue: 7,0:16:46.09,0:16:47.49,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,首先是笑容
Dialogue: 7,0:16:48.50,0:16:51.10,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,要让看的人也想跳起舞来
Dialogue: 7,0:16:51.10,0:16:54.12,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,用欢快的舞步一下子把人吸引住
Dialogue: 7,0:17:01.79,0:17:03.88,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,她的舞蹈好棒
Dialogue: 7,0:17:07.45,0:17:10.62,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,第一跳  阿克塞尔2周跳
Dialogue: 7,0:17:19.81,0:17:22.50,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,接下来  后内点冰2周跳
Dialogue: 7,0:17:24.48,0:17:25.77,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 7,0:17:27.23,0:17:30.57,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,刚才那是  2周跳?
Dialogue: 7,0:17:30.57,0:17:35.69,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,这是… 故意不把最厉害的跳跃放在开头
Dialogue: 7,0:17:42.71,0:17:44.63,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,接下来才是关键
Dialogue: 7,0:17:45.22,0:17:48.51,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,后半段的两个跳跃  得分是1.1倍
Dialogue: 7,0:17:48.51,0:17:51.89,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,我会把最好的跳跃留到那里
Dialogue: 7,0:17:52.23,0:17:53.80,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,不过风险也很高
Dialogue: 7,0:17:53.80,0:17:55.55,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,如果失败了
Dialogue: 7,0:17:55.55,0:17:58.50,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,不止是拿不到1.1倍的得分
Dialogue: 7,0:17:58.50,0:18:00.18,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,还没机会补救了
Dialogue: 7,0:18:00.63,0:18:02.10,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,简直是赌博
Dialogue: 7,0:18:02.66,0:18:03.77,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,一场豪赌
Dialogue: 7,0:18:05.54,0:18:08.85,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,我的体力不够  本就不擅长后半场
Dialogue: 7,0:18:08.85,0:18:11.65,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,就算我想  也没法挑战这种策略
Dialogue: 7,0:18:12.21,0:18:15.45,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,这是以夺冠为目标的  全力以赴的挑战
Dialogue: 7,0:18:28.67,0:18:30.41,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,不好…
Dialogue: 7,0:18:31.16,0:18:34.13,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,还剩三次  还是有点担心
Dialogue: 7,0:18:34.13,0:18:36.29,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,最后一跳还是改成单跳吧
Dialogue: 7,0:18:36.29,0:18:38.74,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,然后把连跳放到下一跳
Dialogue: 7,0:18:41.31,0:18:43.14,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,连跳失误了
Dialogue: 7,0:18:43.70,0:18:46.20,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,只能靠剩下的两跳弥补了
Dialogue: 7,0:18:47.79,0:18:49.26,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,腿好累
Dialogue: 7,0:18:49.75,0:18:52.74,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,可接下来还有两次连跳
Dialogue: 7,0:18:52.74,0:18:54.62,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,我真是笨蛋
Dialogue: 7,0:18:54.62,0:18:58.03,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,明明在前半段跳的话  肯定能成功的
Dialogue: 7,0:18:58.03,0:19:00.29,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,为什么硬要去挑战呢
Dialogue: 7,0:19:01.56,0:19:02.98,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,说什么呢
Dialogue: 7,0:19:04.68,0:19:07.92,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,勇于发起挑战的你  真的很酷啊
Dialogue: 7,0:19:09.85,0:19:12.96,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,是啊  我正是挑战者
Dialogue: 7,0:19:12.96,0:19:14.89,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,不敢于挑战自己的人
Dialogue: 7,0:19:14.89,0:19:18.09,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,又怎么能战胜命运呢
Dialogue: 7,0:19:29.67,0:19:30.62,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,要上了
Dialogue: 7,0:19:38.62,0:19:42.09,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,哦哦哦  最后两跳1.1倍
Dialogue: 7,0:19:54.51,0:19:56.03,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,好可爱
Dialogue: 7,0:19:56.03,0:19:57.84,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,鸡皮疙瘩起来了
Dialogue: 7,0:19:58.40,0:20:02.60,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,把选手的个性彰显出来  很有爱西Ride风格的表演
Dialogue: 7,0:20:02.60,0:20:04.60,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,爱花
Dialogue: 7,0:20:04.60,0:20:07.66,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,别别别  我还没戴上刀套
Dialogue: 7,0:20:07.66,0:20:10.56,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,这不和挥刀乱砍一样了吗
Dialogue: 7,0:20:12.96,0:20:14.84,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,炉场爱花选手的得分是
Dialogue: 7,0:20:15.75,0:20:17.86,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,72.62
Dialogue: 7,0:20:17.86,0:20:21.26,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,目前的排名是  第一名
Dialogue: 7,0:20:22.12,0:20:24.62,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,排名刷新了
Dialogue: 7,0:20:26.87,0:20:28.50,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 7,0:20:36.51,0:20:37.84,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,干得不错
Dialogue: 7,0:20:38.28,0:20:40.34,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,哎呀  那个角度做得真好啊
Dialogue: 7,0:20:57.57,0:20:58.75,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,四叶
Dialogue: 7,0:21:01.35,0:21:02.96,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 7,0:21:11.39,0:21:13.07,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,不用担心  教练
Dialogue: 7,0:21:14.86,0:21:20.09,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,我和慎一郎教练你在冰上待的时间比谁都长
Dialogue: 7,0:21:20.82,0:21:24.35,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,为了证明名港Wind是最强的
Dialogue: 7,0:21:25.54,0:21:29.51,Text_SC,,0,0,0,,我会把这场比赛的金牌带回去
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Comment,,0,0,0,,---------------IN----------------------------
Dialogue: 2,0:16:59.08,0:17:01.79,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Free, my world has no boundaries
Dialogue: 2,0:17:01.79,0:17:02.44,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Step up
Dialogue: 2,0:17:02.44,0:17:05.04,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Sun's shinin', I'm feelin' alright
Dialogue: 2,0:17:05.04,0:17:05.59,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Don't stop
Dialogue: 2,0:17:05.59,0:17:08.24,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Go, a place where I can be me
Dialogue: 2,0:17:08.24,0:17:09.17,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Break free
Dialogue: 2,0:17:09.17,0:17:11.39,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}A strong rhythm it's hittin' just right
Dialogue: 2,0:17:11.80,0:17:12.50,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}C'mon fly
Dialogue: 2,0:17:12.50,0:17:14.89,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}One step, two steps, you light up the stage
Dialogue: 2,0:17:14.89,0:17:15.57,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}I'm queen
Dialogue: 2,0:17:15.57,0:17:18.27,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Take a chance tonight, my heart's yours
Dialogue: 2,0:17:18.27,0:17:19.06,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}It's mine
Dialogue: 2,0:17:19.06,0:17:21.65,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}All eyes on you, it's straight to the top
Dialogue: 2,0:17:21.65,0:17:22.24,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Go on
Dialogue: 2,0:17:22.24,0:17:24.96,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Overcome your limits, that's right
Dialogue: 2,0:17:24.96,0:17:25.77,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}I won't stop
Dialogue: 2,0:17:25.77,0:17:27.78,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}On it, comin' straight for the top, I want it
Dialogue: 2,0:17:27.78,0:17:29.19,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Take a chance on me let's go
Dialogue: 2,0:17:29.19,0:17:30.57,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}You know I'm gonna steal the show
Dialogue: 2,0:17:30.57,0:17:32.72,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Hold on tight now cause I got it
Dialogue: 2,0:17:32.72,0:17:34.28,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}No never gonna stop, jump on it
Dialogue: 2,0:17:34.28,0:17:35.69,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}There's nothing in my way, watch out
Dialogue: 2,0:17:37.20,0:17:38.41,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Can't stop this
Dialogue: 2,0:17:38.41,0:17:41.37,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}But, sometimes when I'm feeling down
Dialogue: 2,0:17:41.37,0:17:42.17,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Cheer up
Dialogue: 2,0:17:42.17,0:17:44.63,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}I see your smile, it's settin' me free
Dialogue: 2,0:17:44.63,0:17:45.22,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Don't stop
Dialogue: 2,0:17:45.22,0:17:48.08,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}When that spotlight's shinin' you'll see
Dialogue: 2,0:17:48.08,0:17:48.86,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Step up
Dialogue: 2,0:17:48.86,0:17:51.42,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Steal your heart, now all eyes on me
Dialogue: 2,0:17:51.42,0:17:52.23,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}C'mon fly
Dialogue: 2,0:17:52.23,0:17:54.61,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}One time, two times, there's no backin' down
Dialogue: 2,0:17:54.61,0:17:55.55,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}I'm queen
Dialogue: 2,0:17:55.55,0:17:57.94,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}See you there, the stage is all yours
Dialogue: 2,0:17:57.94,0:17:58.50,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}It's mine
Dialogue: 2,0:17:58.50,0:18:01.32,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Dreamin' of you, you make me go wild
Dialogue: 2,0:18:01.32,0:18:02.10,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Go on
Dialogue: 2,0:18:02.10,0:18:04.55,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}It's time to shine, your future starts now
Dialogue: 2,0:18:04.55,0:18:05.15,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}I can't stop
Dialogue: 2,0:18:05.15,0:18:06.89,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Love it, hate it, where ya gonna take it
Dialogue: 2,0:18:06.89,0:18:08.43,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Fight for what you want
Dialogue: 2,0:18:08.43,0:18:10.20,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Wheelin'dealin', high up on the feelin'
Dialogue: 2,0:18:10.20,0:18:11.31,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Girl let's have some fun
Dialogue: 2,0:18:11.31,0:18:11.95,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Your love
Dialogue: 2,0:18:11.95,0:18:13.70,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}This is your time, show'em all your shine
Dialogue: 2,0:18:13.70,0:18:15.45,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}There's no limit, girl you gonna make it
Dialogue: 2,0:18:15.45,0:18:16.28,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}See how far you've come
Dialogue: 2,0:18:16.28,0:18:16.98,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Go go
Dialogue: 2,0:18:16.98,0:18:19.33,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}5 4 3 2 1 go
Dialogue: 2,0:18:32.70,0:18:35.31,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Set me free, feel the heat, you and me
Dialogue: 2,0:18:35.31,0:18:37.72,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Runnin' wild we're both feelin' the breeze
Dialogue: 2,0:18:39.43,0:18:40.31,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}A fresh start…
Dialogue: 2,0:19:09.24,0:19:10.93,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}…dance in time, never stop
Dialogue: 2,0:19:10.93,0:19:13.67,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Together going straight to the top
Dialogue: 2,0:19:13.67,0:19:15.16,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}straight to the top
Dialogue: 2,0:19:13.67,0:19:15.16,INJP2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Get yourself ready go
Dialogue: 2,0:19:15.16,0:19:17.70,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Towards our dreams, heart to heart, come with me
Dialogue: 2,0:19:17.70,0:19:20.93,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Ba-dum-dee-dum let's fly
Dialogue: 2,0:19:20.93,0:19:27.54,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Take my hand, set me free, I'm breakin' out
Dialogue: 2,0:19:22.52,0:19:24.51,INJP2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}My freedom my freedom
Dialogue: 2,0:19:24.51,0:19:25.90,INJP2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Gonna take you there, I'mma take you there
Dialogue: 2,0:19:25.90,0:19:27.54,INJP2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Gotta take you there, I'mma take you
Dialogue: 2,0:19:27.54,0:19:33.69,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Step by step, towards our dreams, I won't give in, tonight
Dialogue: 2,0:19:29.18,0:19:31.09,INJP2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}I won't I won't I won't give in, tonight
Dialogue: 2,0:19:31.09,0:19:32.57,INJP2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Gonna take you there, I'mma take you there
Dialogue: 2,0:19:32.57,0:19:33.69,INJP2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Gotta take you there
Dialogue: 3,0:16:59.08,0:17:01.79,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自由  我的天地无疆
Dialogue: 3,0:17:01.79,0:17:02.44,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}登场
Dialogue: 3,0:17:02.44,0:17:05.04,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阳光灿烂  我感觉极好
Dialogue: 3,0:17:05.04,0:17:05.59,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别停下
Dialogue: 3,0:17:05.59,0:17:08.24,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走  这里能做自己
Dialogue: 3,0:17:08.24,0:17:09.17,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}挣脱束缚
Dialogue: 3,0:17:09.17,0:17:11.39,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}强劲律动  直击我胸膛
Dialogue: 3,0:17:11.80,0:17:12.50,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去飞翔
Dialogue: 3,0:17:12.50,0:17:14.89,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一步两步  你将舞台照亮
Dialogue: 3,0:17:14.89,0:17:15.57,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是女王
Dialogue: 3,0:17:15.57,0:17:18.27,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今夜持戈试马  我心奉上
Dialogue: 3,0:17:18.27,0:17:19.06,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}收到
Dialogue: 3,0:17:19.06,0:17:21.65,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}万千目光  助你直上云霄
Dialogue: 3,0:17:21.65,0:17:22.24,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}继续
Dialogue: 3,0:17:22.24,0:17:24.96,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}突破极限  这才像样
Dialogue: 3,0:17:24.96,0:17:25.77,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我绝不停下
Dialogue: 3,0:17:25.77,0:17:27.78,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}盯住目标  我想要直上云霄
Dialogue: 3,0:17:27.78,0:17:29.19,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}押我身上  马上出发
Dialogue: 3,0:17:29.19,0:17:30.57,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道我会抢走全场目光
Dialogue: 3,0:17:30.57,0:17:32.72,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抓稳了  我已掌控全场
Dialogue: 3,0:17:32.72,0:17:34.28,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}绝不停下  纵身而上
Dialogue: 3,0:17:34.28,0:17:35.69,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}前方无阻  当心
Dialogue: 3,0:17:37.20,0:17:38.41,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}势不可挡
Dialogue: 3,0:17:38.41,0:17:41.37,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有时我感到沮丧
Dialogue: 3,0:17:41.37,0:17:42.17,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打起精神
Dialogue: 3,0:17:42.17,0:17:44.63,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看到你的笑容  便心情舒畅
Dialogue: 3,0:17:44.63,0:17:45.22,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别停下
Dialogue: 3,0:17:45.22,0:17:48.08,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当聚光灯亮起  你便知晓
Dialogue: 3,0:17:48.08,0:17:48.86,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}登场
Dialogue: 3,0:17:48.86,0:17:51.42,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}俘获你的心  万众所望
Dialogue: 3,0:17:51.42,0:17:52.23,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去飞翔
Dialogue: 3,0:17:52.23,0:17:54.61,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一次两次  不再退让
Dialogue: 3,0:17:54.61,0:17:55.55,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是女王
Dialogue: 3,0:17:55.55,0:17:57.94,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}台上见  你掌控全场
Dialogue: 3,0:17:57.94,0:17:58.50,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错
Dialogue: 3,0:17:58.50,0:18:01.32,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就是我的梦想  令人痴狂
Dialogue: 3,0:18:01.32,0:18:02.10,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}继续
Dialogue: 3,0:18:02.10,0:18:04.55,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此刻闪耀  你的未来就此启航
Dialogue: 3,0:18:04.55,0:18:05.15,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我无可阻挡
Dialogue: 3,0:18:05.15,0:18:06.89,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爱它恨它  你要带它往何方
Dialogue: 3,0:18:06.89,0:18:08.43,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为心中所愿而战
Dialogue: 3,0:18:08.43,0:18:10.20,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}周旋博弈  心潮澎湃
Dialogue: 3,0:18:10.20,0:18:11.31,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}姑娘  一起来欢畅
Dialogue: 3,0:18:11.31,0:18:11.95,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的爱
Dialogue: 3,0:18:11.95,0:18:13.70,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是你的时刻  展现所有光芒
Dialogue: 3,0:18:13.70,0:18:15.45,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里没有极限  你一定能做到
Dialogue: 3,0:18:15.45,0:18:16.28,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看看你的来时路有多长
Dialogue: 3,0:18:16.28,0:18:16.98,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}出发  出发
Dialogue: 3,0:18:16.98,0:18:19.33,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}5 4 3 2 1 出发
Dialogue: 3,0:18:32.70,0:18:35.31,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我释放  感热量  就你我
Dialogue: 3,0:18:35.31,0:18:37.72,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}随心驰骋  共沐清风
Dialogue: 3,0:18:39.43,0:18:40.31,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}新起点…
Dialogue: 3,0:19:09.24,0:19:10.93,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}…随拍跳  不停歇
Dialogue: 3,0:19:10.93,0:19:13.67,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一起直奔云霄
Dialogue: 3,0:19:13.67,0:19:15.16,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}直奔云霄
Dialogue: 3,0:19:13.67,0:19:15.16,INCN2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}准备好  出发
Dialogue: 3,0:19:15.16,0:19:17.70,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朝梦想  心连心  随我来
Dialogue: 3,0:19:17.70,0:19:20.93,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}扑通扑通  一同飞翔
Dialogue: 3,0:19:20.93,0:19:27.54,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}牵我手  将我释放  我要冲出围墙
Dialogue: 3,0:19:22.52,0:19:24.51,INCN2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的自由  我的自由
Dialogue: 3,0:19:24.51,0:19:25.90,INCN2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我将带你前往  带你前往
Dialogue: 3,0:19:25.90,0:19:27.54,INCN2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我定带你前往  带你前往
Dialogue: 3,0:19:27.54,0:19:33.69,INCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一步步  朝着梦想  今夜绝不退让
Dialogue: 3,0:19:29.18,0:19:31.09,INCN2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}绝不  绝不  绝不退让
Dialogue: 3,0:19:31.09,0:19:32.57,INCN2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我将带你前往  带你前往
Dialogue: 3,0:19:32.57,0:19:33.69,INCN2,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我定带你前往
